	<markup_html><![CDATA[<section class="fit-section">
    <div class="fit-inner">
      <div class="fit-panel">
        <h2>Good Fit</h2>
        <ul class="fit-list">
          <li><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i><span>Your current tools almost work, but manual workarounds are slowing the team down.</span></li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i><span>You need software that connects several systems into one reliable workflow.</span></li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i><span>You have device, operational, or customer data that should drive decisions automatically.</span></li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-check-circle"></i><span>You are shipping software and need better QA coverage before customers find problems.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="fit-panel">
        <h2>Usually Not a Fit</h2>
        <ul class="fit-list">
          <li><i class="ph ph-x-circle"></i><span>A basic marketing website where a simple template would do the job.</span></li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-x-circle"></i><span>A generic app idea without a clear user, workflow, or business outcome.</span></li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-x-circle"></i><span>Replacing a proven off-the-shelf tool just because custom sounds more exciting.</span></li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-x-circle"></i><span>AI features where rules, forms, or straightforward automation would be safer and cheaper.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>]]></markup_html>
